# A photo pushed from the computer appears under Photos when the reader wakes.
expect Picture puzzles
tap Photos
wait-for No photo puzzles yet
companion nonograms push apps/frame/sample-photo.jpg --name Harbour --size 9 --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for Harbour
expect Your photos
expect 9×9
expect-missing No photo puzzles yet
clean
shot nonograms-photos-listed
# A photo puzzle plays like any other and shows the photo when solved.
tap Harbour
wait-for-id more
expect 0/81
tap-id board.cell.0
expect 1/81
tap-id more
expect Harbour
tap Back
tap-id 4294967295
# A second push adds to the shelf, and --replace keeps only what it names.
companion nonograms push apps/frame/sample-photo.jpg --name Garden --size 15 --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for Garden
expect Harbour
expect Pan to play
clean
shot nonograms-photos-two
companion nonograms push apps/frame/sample-photo.jpg --name Garden --size 15 --replace --sim
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-idle
wait 1000
wait-idle
expect Garden
expect-missing Harbour
# The photos and their progress are still there after a restart.
restart
wait-for Nonograms
tap Photos
wait-for Garden
expect-missing No photo puzzles yet
